// Фракції › Групи FFR (VPP rework 2026-11-12, design §5.2; artboard FactionsFfr): the page of a server whose factions come from FFR_GroupSpawner through OpenZone Identity FFR. The groups of FFR's file on the left -- players, the OpenZone faction each maps to, its state -- and the names the mapping looks for that FFR has no group for now; on the right the picked group's faction, the settings for every group (base faction, who spends the research pool, the reload period) and what the trader's faction, post and leader conditions mean on such a server; a draft bar at the bottom: what changed, discard and apply (both on the confirm strip). The glue is a server mod, so this page lives in OpenZone_VPP and is registered only when the server's identity says its source is OpenZone Identity FFR. Edits go to OZ_Identity_FFR.json through cfg_get/cfg_set; FFR's own file is only read. Created by OZ_VppMenu.FfrRegister; the shell moves it into the content area. Laid out at the content size of the default window (1060 x 680). Names FfrList, FfrGroupsCount, FfrMissing, FfrPickName, FfrPickInfo, FfrFacId, FfrBase, FfrReload, FfrTrade*, FfrBarText and the Btn* names are read by OZ_VppMenu.c.
